---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';

const pageTitle = `${SITE_TITLE} | 个人博客`;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={pageTitle} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
		<style>
			.badge {
				display: inline-flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				height: 1.6em;
				padding: 0 0.65rem;
				border-radius: 999px;
				color: white;
				font-weight: bold;
				line-height: 1;
				white-space: nowrap;
				vertical-align: middle;
			}
			.badge + .badge {
				margin-left: 0.35rem;
			}
			.badge-211 {
				background-color: #ff69b4;
			}
			.badge-shuang {
				background-color: #4169e1;
			}
			.card {
				display: flex;
			}
			.card-left{
				flex:1;
				margin-right: 30px;
				border-right: 1px solid rgb(var(--gray-light));
				padding-right: 30px;
			}
			@media (max-width: 720px) {
				.card {
					flex-direction: column;
				}
				.card-left{
					border-right: none;
					border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--gray-light));
					padding-right: 0;
				}
			}
			.card-right{
				flex:1;
				
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Hi,I'm Navi Lee!</h1>
			
			<p>
			Frontend Developer | React | TypeScript | AI Enthusiast 
			</p>

			<div>
				<span>太原理工大学</span>
				<span>
					<span class="badge badge-211">211</span><span class="badge badge-shuang">双一流</span>
				</span>
				<span> | 软件工程 </span>
				<span> | 2029届本科</span>
			</div>

			<div class="card">
			<div class="card-left">
			<p>
			如果你想看看我的日常随笔与技术博客，请点击上方的Blog。如果你想与我交流，欢迎随时发送邮件至<a href='mailto:LeeNavi@foxmail.com'>LeeNavi@foxmail.com</a>。
			</p>
			</div>
			<div class='card-right'>
			<p>想看过去的我？这里有旧版网站。旧版网站:<a href="https://legacy.navilee.com">Legacy.navilee.com</a></p>
			</div>
			</div>
			<p>
				本网站技术栈为Astro.js,使用Vercel部署。
			</p>
			

			

		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
